## 验证 checklist

每次 commit + push 后必自检:

- [ ] 涉及的所有 task 已 `completed`
- [ ] sub-worktree 已 `git worktree remove`(如果这是 isolated session)
- [ ] 本地 branch 已 `git branch -d`
- [ ] 远端 branch 已 `git push origin --delete`
- [ ] `git -C <主 worktree> worktree list` 不含本次 worktree
- [ ] `git -C <主 worktree> branch -a` 不含本次 branch (除非 ff-merged develop)
